---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About and Settings">
    <section class="about-settings-section">
        <h2 class="text-teal-400 my-1.5">About and Settings</h2>
        <div>
            <p>
                The about and settings page provides information about the FossilGeo app, its purpose, and how to use it. It also includes options for
                customizing the app's appearance and functionality to suit your preferences. You can learn about the data sources used in the app, and find
                links to additional resources for exploring geology and fossils. In here you can also find the disclaimer for the app, which outlines the
                limitations and responsibilities of using FossilGeo. The app is designed to be user-friendly and informative, making it a valuable tool for
                anyone interested in geology and fossils.
            </p>
            <p>
                Also a reporting mechanism for users to provide feedback or report issues with the app, helping to improve the user experience and ensure the
                app remains a reliable resource for geological and fossil information. The main setting available is the ability to add a quick access list of
                favourite locations, which can be easily accessed from the home page. This allows users to quickly view geological and fossil information for
                their preferred locations without having to search for them each time.
            </p>
